<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2PE - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETƆLÀ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan wàyweel wà Petɔlà</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 PETƆLÀ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan wàyweel wà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petɔlà</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan a Petɔlà wàyweel bàtöm anki itàkal akà Ikööŋ a bul làmwɛy, itàkal naa akundweer a isal mwɛy, itàkal naa akaklistɔ bàpää u mɛɛn. Waa wun'kaan a un'sɛŋ anà waa sye wasànaa kyän a dweelà. Ndaa a ngwal awa yà ntɔn munwaan a baar bàfiipay ngyɛb an'lɔŋ a nsöön a Làsaŋ, làsaŋ aŋàbwaŋ là Nzam. Ndaa a mfun Ungö a mbɔr a nsɛmà, indiir itär bye muyilääb. Wàntàtɛr wàmuŋyɛm unsà ndaa iler làbɔ̈ɔ̈n bàwɛl akà Nzam anà unsà imbäl a baar abà bàmɛn Mwol. Wàyweel mutɔn a ngwal isal a alɔɔŋ a loor bàfàkwaar mbwo a ndaa ndandaa anà yà balàbal. Wàtär utɔn ndaa mwɛy unsà ntɛn a ba: ba bàfàtɛn naa ngyeel a Klistɔ isàkal anki. Petɔlà kàfuur naa isàkal naa ya yan'kyer itaan, yàntɔn nkääŋàmpem a Nzam. Mbɔr a ntsü yàmupà un'kanà anà ngwal akà baar awà bàtöm waa anà akun'tääŋ a un'kaan awà wanswà. Mɛɛn màkɔ̈ɔ̈n anki akà ikikye anà baar bàfàkɔ̈ɔ̈n a kwaar Làsaŋ. Un'kaan a Petɔlà wàyweel wà un'kaan a ndaa: waa wàmupà un'kanà akà aklistɔ mukyà usà unsà ngyööb a Mwol, ntɔn mukɔɔn a tɔɔmà ndwaŋ umbwo a an'lɔŋ aŋàtà mbeen anà màbɔɔmà. Asöön itàkal atääŋ a biblɛ bamwɛy bàfàtɛn naa un'kaan awà wà ntööm Petɔlà kusà a ukwà nde u mbul wà an'kwem an'syaam aŋinà ungö a Yɛsu Klistɔ. Itàkal naa abà, undiir kan'söön uboo awa, yà ngyeel a Mwol. Ngö a nsööŋ a ngyeel a Mwol ayi, wà undiir mwɛy akà baar mpa abà Ayudà anà aklistɔ binkye mubɛy ya. Abun, un'kaan wàmuyɔɔb naa ngö a nsöŋ umii a Mwol kà ndaa a ngwal anki, wɛɛ nkääŋ a mpem ande ayà yaay bàpɛ akà baar banswà ntɔn muwal mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà musɔɔm nkääl. Un'kaan awà, wàmusà an'kyän unsà in'kaan a Nkwà itaan asànaa Nkwà akün. Abà yàkäl ndaa a ngywoolà a ntabwey a Mwol, amu ya Petɔlà wàŋàtà din.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Mɛ Simɔn Petɔlà, un'syääl anà ntööm a Yɛsu Klistɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">An'söön baar abà bàwɛl làkwikilà aŋàbwaŋ asànaa bi unsà balàbal a Nzam abi anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Wɛy kab a ngway anà duu màkäl mbɔɔn anà bɛ, u mbwo a ngyööb a Nzam anà Yɛsu, Mwol abi!<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làbeel anà nsɔ̈ɔ̈l a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Abun, ngwal a du yipɛ kab aya yanswà yà ndöŋ ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà inzaam, ntɔn bi iyöb mbuur kibel unsà làkoo ande ŋakwo anà ngwal ifàsal. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Kyakin, bi kàwɛl an'kab a ntal akölàköl amà bipɛ ilää, ntɔn, u mbwo a ma, bɛ làwɛl kab unsà inzaam, bɛ baar bàlagyɔɔr unsà làbiin ufàdii ilään a mɛɛn.<verse eid="2PE 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Kyakin, làsi ngwal abɛ yanswà mukwɛy làkwikilà unsà nkääl aŋàbwaŋ, unsà nkääl aŋàbwaŋ, làsi ngyööb, <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>unsà ngyööb, nkääŋ a mpem, unsà nkääŋ a mpem, imbämdir, unsà imbämdir, inzaam, <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>unsà inzaam, un'tüüb a atɔŋ a atɔŋ, unsà un'tüüb a atɔŋ a atɔŋ, ukwen. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa bɛ làbye anà nkääl ayi yàmbɔɔn, ya iyàlasiinà musal anà muyɛl unsà ngyööb a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Wɛɛ akà mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n bya, nde wà ikwàmii, nde akyer afàbàba: nde uyöb anki naa nde wàŋàpɔŋà unsà man'be ande mà itaan.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Kyakin, atɔŋ, fàlasye ngwal ntɔn mutà làbeel abɛ mpi anà nsɔ̈ɔ̈l abɛ. Abun, waa bɔɔmà abwà mpa bàkal akà ikikye. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Kyakin, waa mbiilà abɛ unsà Imwol a mbul a in'tye kyà Mwol anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi Yɛsu Klistɔ isàkal yàŋàduub kölàköl.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Kyakin, mɛ in'wɛy anki mufàlayɔɔb indiir abi, itàkal naa bɛ bya làkyàyöb anà bɛ làbà aŋàtsim unsà ndandaa ayà bàlapɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Wɛɛ mɛ in'sii naa yàbalàbal muwiy an'kyän abɛ u mbwo a ngyɔɔb amɛ umpal in'wà mɛ uboo a ipfey a ndür ki. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Ntɔn mɛ in'kyàyöb naa taaŋ muwɛy ipfey a ndür aki làmuyà u ntiin, asànaa kan'swɛŋ Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'sàsà ngwal naa ungö a nkyeen amɛ, bɛ làyɔbà an'lɔɔŋ amà taaŋ lanswà.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa a aŋangɔɔm yan'kwo amu Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Abun, kà ntɔn mulab nsim a ntwan anki waa bi kàlakyään ngyeel a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ unsà ngwal ande yanswà, wɛɛ ntɔn kàmɛn bi uteer ande u mii abi ŋakwo! <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Ntɔn nde kàwɛl ibyääl anà làkoo akà Taa Nzam, umpal kàtɛn nde a nde unsà làkoo ande làkölàköl naa: « Wà, wà mwaan amɛ wànkwen, awà kàsi mɛ un'sak amɛ amu nde. » <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Ndaa ayi yàfü du, bi ŋakwo kàkyer awem ya, umpal kàkäl bi anà nde u mɔŋ in'kyɛɛl.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Abun, bi ibye anà ndaa a bwoor yàŋangɔɔm. Bɛ làkäl anà iböŋ musà mii abɛ udu aya asànaa mwin afàlɛɛmà kà ikal a làpib, tii umpal làyaanà taaŋ anà uyàsɛnà mbwaar a tutu uboo a mpem abɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Kusà aya yanswà, làyöb abà: akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki nde ŋakwo mutà itàkal mubaal ngɔɔm ayà uboo a Ndaa Aŋàsɔn. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Kyakin, ngɔɔm kà ifàfà anki akà ikikye unsà ukwen a mbuur, wɛɛ unsà ngwal a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl waa baar bàyäm kà ikↄb a Nzam.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Alɔɔŋ a loor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JUD 1:4-13">Yud 4-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Asànaa bàkäl aŋangɔɔm a loor uboo a un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl, abun sye, bàsàkal alɔɔŋ a loor uboo a bɛ. Ba bàsàbiil an'lɔɔŋ an'be a ntwan, tii mutɔn Un'lɔɔŋ awà katsü mɔ̈ɔ̈. Kwɛl a mbɔɔn tɛy, ma màsabwiy ndwaŋ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Baar mbɔɔn bàsàlab mbweel a ndwaŋ aba. Ntɔn ba, mbwo a ndandaa isàbulà undiir mwɛy wàŋàbɛy. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Unsà küüb a ngim, alɔɔŋ a loor abà bàsàwal indiir abɛ u mbwo ndaa a ntsà. Wɛɛ ntɔn ba, fà itaan, ntaaŋàmbar aba kwɛl yatɛy anà ukwà aba bàyàfàdil anki.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Ntɔn, Nzam kàwɛy anki akyeey bàkyer man'be, wɛɛ nde katɔɔm u nsye a mbaa, bàŋàbäm an'dwaaŋ ntɔn mudil mbar. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Nde sye kàwɛy anki taaŋ là itaan, wɛɛ nde kàyee Nɔwà, mbuur wànaan uboo a baar bàsɔrà unsà ukwà, nde mbuur kàlɔɔŋà balàbal umpal kàdwä Nzam baar abe kà an'dà umpal kànɔ̈ mbul a ikül. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Ungö apan, nde kàpɛ ntaaŋàmbar akà an'bul a Sɔdɔm anà Gɔmɔr anà ma mabulà un'twà ntɔn muswaŋ mbaan akà baar abe abà bàsàyà ungö. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtsü Lɔt mɔ̈ɔ̈, mbuur a balàbal awà kàwem ngyɛb ntɔn isal aŋingyäy byà atɔŋ ande. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Ntɔn mbuur a balàbal awà kàkäl umwɛy uboo a ba, nde kàkyer amanà anà kàkyer awemà: ilä ungö ilä, mpem ande yàkyer ayɔɔ ntɔn isal aba byà ŋingyäy. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Abun, Mwol an'kwo ulwom u nsii baar a balàbal anà usi ukɔl baar mpa abà bàbalàbal ntɔn mukapà ntaaŋàmbar kà ilä a nsaŋ. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Ntaaŋàmbar ayi yà sin sin ntɔn baar bàfàkwen ŋingyäy. Ba bàfàlab ilään a ndür aba anà bàfàbɛy ikɔ̈b a Nzam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Alɔɔŋ a loor abà bye anà gyɔɔr anà uyɔl, bɔɔmà akà ba batɛy mubweel baar a làkoo a du in'tswe. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Itàkal akyeey ban'lyaaŋ ikɔ̈b anà ngwal udu a ba, bàfàtɛn anki ndaa a nswɛn akà ba u mii a Mwol. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Wɛɛ ba bà asànaa ntsür a insil ifàkwɛlà anà ifàkwà unsà intaam. Ba bàfàto indiir mpa bàyöb ba. Ba bàkyer asàpɔɔn asànaa ufàpɔɔn ntsür. <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Abà, ba bàsàwal làfur a un'kɔl aŋàyↄŋ aba. Un'sak aba wàmukyer ndaa a nswɛn kà imɛɛy. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Mii aba myàŋàyɔl a inswem, ba bàfàyuur anki mukyer man'be, ba bàfàlwab baar mpa abàŋàtsim. Ba bàkyàtoo làpaan a ngyal a ngim. Un'küül a Nzam wà udu a ba! <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Ba ban'wɛy mbwo a swalaa, ba ban'yiiŋ ntɔn mulab mbwo a Bàlam mwan a Bɔsɔr, awà kàbü unsà ndɛb a làfur làkɔ̈ɔ̈n balàbal, <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>wɛɛ nde kàwɛl làfur a un'tswe bwoor ande: ntsür a nkiin mwɛy wà isal kàsi ndaa asànaa mbuur, abun, ukɔŋ a ŋangɔɔm awà waa bàwü.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Baar abà bà asànaa ntwà mpa ifàtwey an'dà anà an'tööb ufiisyen un'pöb. Ba bàkyalɔ̈ɔ̈n ikal u diŋàdiŋ a mpib. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Abun, unsà an'lɔɔŋ aba màŋàyam a uyɔl anà màbunàbun, ba bàfàlwab baar ban'sɔrà benàben kà an'kɔɔ a baar abye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ un'be. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Ba bàfasyeel ilää ntɔn mukapà insaay, wɛɛ, kyekà ba ŋakwo bà asɔ a ilään ifatwääl ukwà, ntɔn mbuur wanswà wà un'sɔ a undiir awà afun'yaal. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Abun, isàkal naa baar bàsɔrà kà an'kɔɔ a mbiin a mɛɛn u mbwo a ngyööb a Yɛsu Klistɔ, Mwol anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi, ban'fàbwà anà bàmàfayaal unsà mbiin a mɛɛn, mpay aba yàngöngö yan'söön yàtàtwɛb. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Ntɔn yàlàkal ubwaŋ akà ba mukɔɔn ayöb mbwo a balàbal, wɛɛ kàmuyöb ya anki, waa ungö bàfàtɔn nswɛɛŋ a in'kyɛɛl ayà bàtöm. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Ya yayeel asànaa kyàtɛn itim asànaa ayà ya: « Mbwà kan'fàfurà kà ilwo ande » naa sye: « Ngul un'kyay bàmun'ywɛy làbenàben, kan'fàbibimà uboo a antwar. »<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ilää a ngyeel a Mwol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Asam amɛ, wà wun'kaan wàyweel alàsöön mɛ. Uboo a mya myemyeel, mɛ an'lɔm akà ngyɔɔb abɛ ntɔn muwiy amu bɛ nsyääl a balàbal muyweer. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Làyɔbà ndaa bàtɛn aŋangɔɔm in'kyɛɛl kusà anà nswɛɛŋ a antööm abɛ, nswɛɛŋ a Mwol anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Làyöb kusà naa: kà ilä a ntsüü, baar a nkääl ambe bàsàkyer ayà, waa bàsàlasɛ, <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>bàsàtɛn naa: « Kyàken ilä a ngyeel ande? Ntɔn, fà bàkü ataa, akà nsɔɔmà mwɛy yi yatɛy. Ndaa yanswà yà ifà imwɛy fà bàkyer mɛɛn! » <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Unsà ntɛɛn aba ayi, ba ban'diimà naa fà itaan itaan, làkäl anà du. Anà mɛɛn màtoo unsà an'dà, ma mà uboboo a an'dà unsà ngwal a Nzam. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>U mbwo a ma sye, mɛɛn mà itaan màminà uboo a an'dà. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Unsà ndaa iler du anà mɛɛn a ŋàbà, Ndaa nsil ya yàmadil ntɔn mbaa, kà ilä a nsaŋ, anà ukwà a baar abe.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Asam amɛ bànkwen, we anà undiir mwɛy mpa lan'kwo bɛ mukyäärà mpiim: ntɔn akà Mwol, ilä mwɛy kyà asànaa nsaab mwɛy yà mbul, anà nsaab mwɛy yà mbul yà sànaa ilä mwɛy. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Akà Mwol ngö a nsöŋ yatɛy mukwey ilää ande, asànaa bàfàsii bamwɛy naa nde asàkyer itaan, wɛɛ nde we anà nkääŋ a mpem ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn nde ukwen anki naa bamwɛy bàkü, wɛɛ, naa baar banswà bàbuul mpem aba. <verse eid="2PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Wɛɛ ilä a Mwol isàyà asànaa mbüüb. Ilä làsàdubà du, làso làsàkal làkölàköl, indiir aŋàbääb ikyer asàkaabà, mɛɛn anà isal ama màsàkal u nsaŋ. <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Mpal isàpää indiir abi byanswà, bɛ làsàkal baar a nkye ifà! Mɔ̈ɔ̈ in'kyɛɛl nà! Làzir nà akà Nzam! <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Bɛ, bɛ baar làkadilà anà làkanaanà ngyeel a ilä a Nzam, ilä làsàyaalà du aŋàkuŋà anà indiir aŋàbääb ikyer asàyaalà! <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Bi ibà mudilà du akün anà mɛɛn akün asànaa akyà ilää ande, ikal làbà bàbalàbal. <verse eid="2PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Kyakin, asam amɛ, unsà ndiil ayi, làkyer ngwal ntɔn nde kàlamɛn unsà duu aŋàkwo anà làkɔ̈ɔ̈n an'pɛl. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Anà làyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa nkääŋ a mpem a kölàköl a Mwol, yà ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ! Yà unsà an'kyän amà, waa Pɔl, un'tɔŋ anà un'sam abi, kàmàlasöön asànaa amà an'yeerà kun'pɛ Nzam. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Ndaa ayi nde ya kan'tɛn sye unsà in'kaan myanswà kàsön nde: Ye anà ndaa yumwɛy yà bwoor muyöb uboo a in'kaan ami, insil anà baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'yɛnà la bàfakwaar ba an'kyän a mya, asànaa bàfàkwaar ba an'kyän a In'kaan myumwɛy ntɔn ba ŋakwo bàbü ndwaŋ. <verse eid="2PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, ankwen amɛ, asànaa lan'yöb bɛ kusà, làkäl unsà igyɛɛŋ, twon lan'lab abɛɛy abà bàfàdiimà mbwo anà twon lan'piy làkyän abɛ! <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Wɛɛ làyɛl unsà kab angway anà ngyööb a Mwol anà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi Yɛsu Klistɔ. Wɛy làkoo làkäl akà nde fà ŋàbà tii mbul a in'tye. Wöö wöö.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
